# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage/
.tmp/
*.local

# Agent git worktrees (isolation). Never committed, and — because Biome uses
# `vcs.useIgnoreFile` — this keeps their nested biome.jsonc from tripping the
# repo-wide Biome pass with a "nested root configuration" error.
.claude/worktrees/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
node_modules/
docker/pgpass
docker/local/pgpass

# Env files are local-only, anywhere in the tree — only `.env.example`
# templates are tracked (AGENTS.md § Security: never commit .env files or
# credentials). These patterns are deliberately path-less so they cover every
# workspace: the previous per-path list left the repo root and most of
# packages/* uncovered, and a workspace `.env` still reached git carrying
# a DB_PASSWORD.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Findings reports are PRODUCED ON DEMAND and never committed (ADR-049). A
# measurement in git is stale from the next commit onward with nothing to say so,
# and one of these was for 22 merges (#304). Name the command instead:
# `vp run lint:report`, `vp run fallow:full`, `vp run sonar:report`.
#
# Gate BASELINES are the exception and stay tracked, because a gate diffs against
# them rather than merely reporting them: reports/api-surface/ (api-surface:verify)
# and reports/fallow/baselines/ (fallow audit --gate new-only).
reports/*/*-latest.json
reports/fallow/complexity-threshold-analysis.md
reports/skills/*.md

# Fallow per-run artifacts (canonical root: reports/fallow/ — see AGENTS.md)
reports/fallow/runs/

# PR queue operator decision logs — one directory per pass, produced on demand
# by `vp run pr:queue` (ADR-049).
reports/pr-queue/runs/

# The coordination board is a local-only VIEW, regenerated on demand with
# `vp run coordination:board` (ADR-037). It is never committed: a committed
# generated file is what made every concurrent coordination PR collide. The
# task files under docs/coordination/tasks/ are the source of truth.
docs/coordination/BOARD.md

# Sonar per-run artifacts — every target, main included (scripts/lib/sonar-report-path.mjs)
reports/sonar/runs/*
!reports/sonar/runs/.gitkeep
